
{
  "content": "\n    <h3 id=\"supplementary-resources-on-authors\">Supplementary Resources on Authors</h3>\n\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://voices.cla.umn.edu/artistpages/angelouMaya.php\"  aria-label=\"Maya Angelou - Voices from the Gaps (opens in a new tab)\"  >Maya Angelou - Voices from the Gaps</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.owtoad.com/\"  aria-label=\"Margaret Atwood Website (opens in a new tab)\"  >Margaret Atwood Website</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://www.poetryfoundation.org/poets/james-baldwin\"  aria-label=\"James Baldwin - Web Resources (opens in a new tab)\"  >James Baldwin - Web Resources</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://www.econlib.org/build-barbara-build-reflections-on-nickel-and-dimed/\"  aria-label=\"Barbara Ehrenreich - Web Resources on Nickel and Dimed (opens in a new tab)\"  >Barbara Ehrenreich - Web Resources on <em>Nickel and Dimed</em></a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.ushmm.org/exhibition/anne-frank/htmlsite/\"  aria-label=\"Anne Frank - United States Holocaust Memorial Museum Exhibit (opens in a new tab)\"  >Anne Frank - United States Holocaust Memorial Museum Exhibit</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://thekingcenter.org/about-tkc/martin-luther-king-jr/\"  aria-label=\"Martin Luther King, Jr.- Web Resources (opens in a new tab)\"  >Martin Luther King, Jr.- Web Resources</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://www.chipublib.org/tim-obrien-biography/\"  aria-label=\"Tim O&amp;rsquo;Brien - Web Site (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tim O&rsquo;Brien - Web Site</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://www.georgiaencyclopedia.org/articles/arts-culture/flannery-oconnor-1925-1964\"  aria-label=\"Flannery O&amp;rsquo;Connor- Web Resources (opens in a new tab)\"  >Flannery O&rsquo;Connor- Web Resources</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.tillieolsen.net/about-tillie.php\"  aria-label=\"Tillie Olsen - Web Resources (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tillie Olsen - Web Resources</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://www.orwellfoundation.com/the-orwell-foundation/about/about-george-orwell/\"  aria-label=\"George Orwell - Web Resources (opens in a new tab)\"  >George Orwell - Web Resources</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://voices.cla.umn.edu/artistpages/tanAmy.php\"  aria-label=\"Amy Tan- Voices from the Gaps (opens in a new tab)\"  >Amy Tan- Voices from the Gaps</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://voices.cla.umn.edu/artistpages/walkerAlice.php\"  aria-label=\"Alice Walker- Voices from the Gaps (opens in a new tab)\"  >Alice Walker- Voices from the Gaps</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://english.stanford.edu/people/tobias-wolff\"  aria-label=\"Tobias Wolff- Web Resources (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tobias Wolff- Web Resources</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"readings-and-dramatic-versions-of-assigned-short-stories\">Readings and Dramatic Versions of Assigned Short Stories</h3>\n\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20090409121800/http://www.chicagopublicradio.org/audio_library/sos_03audio.asp\"  aria-label=\"Tim O&amp;rsquo;Brien- Reading of &amp;ldquo;The Things They Carried&amp;rdquo; by Rob Riley (Chicago Public Radio) (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tim O&rsquo;Brien- Reading of &ldquo;The Things They Carried&rdquo; by Rob Riley (Chicago Public Radio)</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.thisamericanlife.org/Radio_Episode.aspx?sched=819\"  aria-label=\"Tillie Olsen reading excerpts from &amp;ldquo;I Stand Here Ironing&amp;rdquo; on This American Life (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tillie Olsen reading excerpts from &ldquo;I Stand Here Ironing&rdquo; on This American Life</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.thisamericanlife.org/Radio_Episode.aspx?sched=1145\"  aria-label=\"Tobias Wolff reading &amp;ldquo;Bullet in the Brain&amp;rdquo; on This American Life (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tobias Wolff reading &ldquo;Bullet in the Brain&rdquo; on <em>This American Life</em></a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0325129/\"  aria-label=\"Tobias Wolff - film version of &amp;ldquo;Bullet in the Brain&amp;rdquo; (opens in a new tab)\"  >Tobias Wolff - film version of &ldquo;Bullet in the Brain&rdquo;</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"documentary-film\">Documentary Film</h3>\n\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://imdb.com/title/tt0373193/\"  aria-label=\"No Logo (opens in a new tab)\"  >No Logo</a> (More information on this film is available on the <a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.mediaed.org/videos/CommercialismPoliticsAndMedia/NoLogo\"  aria-label=\"Media Education Foundation (opens in a new tab)\"  >Media Education Foundation</a> Web site.)</p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://imdb.com/title/tt0092999/\"  aria-label=\"Eyes on the Prize (opens in a new tab)\"  >Eyes on the Prize</a> (More information on this film series is available on the <a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://museum.tv/\"  aria-label=\"Museum of Broadcast Communications (opens in a new tab)\"  >Museum of Broadcast Communications</a> Web site.)</p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"additional-short-story-resources\">Additional Short Story Resources</h3>\n\n<p>Stories on Stage - Chicago Public Radio</p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070128225244/http://www.scribblingwomen.org/home.html\"  aria-label=\"&amp;ldquo;Scribbling Women&amp;rdquo;: Dramatizations of Stories by American Women (opens in a new tab)\"  >&ldquo;Scribbling Women&rdquo;: Dramatizations of Stories by American Women</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.csustan.edu/english/reuben/pal/TABLE.HTML\"  aria-label=\"Perspectives on American Literature - Reference Guide (opens in a new tab)\"  >Perspectives on American Literature - Reference Guide</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"student-publications\">Student Publications</h3>\n\n<p>Counterpoint</p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://murj.mit.edu/\"  aria-label=\"MURJ: MIT Undergraduate Research Journal (opens in a new tab)\"  >MURJ: MIT Undergraduate Research Journal</a></p>\n<p>Rune</p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://thetech.com/\"  aria-label=\"The Tech (opens in a new tab)\"  >The Tech</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"mit-writing-resources\">MIT Writing Resources</h3>\n\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://dspace.mit.edu/handle/1721.1/39101\"  aria-label=\"MIT Program In Writing and Humanistic Studies (opens in a new tab)\"  >MIT Program In Writing and Humanistic Studies</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://cmsw.mit.edu/writing-and-communication-center/\"  aria-label=\"MIT Writing Center (opens in a new tab)\"  >MIT Writing Center</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.mit.edu/commreq/index.html\"  aria-label=\"MIT Communication Requirement (opens in a new tab)\"  >MIT Communication Requirement</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://cmsw.mit.edu/tag/writing-across-the-curriculum/\"  aria-label=\"Writing Across the Curriculum at MIT (opens in a new tab)\"  >Writing Across the Curriculum at MIT</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"writing-prize-competitions\">Writing Prize Competitions</h3>\n\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://cmsw.mit.edu/publications/ilona-karmel-writing-prizes/\"  aria-label=\"Ilona Karmel Writing Prizes (opens in a new tab)\"  >Ilona Karmel Writing Prizes</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.mit.edu/wgs/prize/\"  aria-label=\"Louis Kampf Writing Prize in Women&amp;rsquo;s Studies (opens in a new tab)\"  >Louis Kampf Writing Prize in Women&rsquo;s Studies</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.mit.edu/kdfund/essay/index.html\"  aria-label=\"L. Austin Kelly Essay Prizes (opens in a new tab)\"  >L. Austin Kelly Essay Prizes</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://sts-program.mit.edu/benjamin-siegel-writing-prize/\"  aria-label=\"Benjamin Siegel Prize in Science, Technology and Society (opens in a new tab)\"  >Benjamin Siegel Prize in Science, Technology and Society</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.mit.edu/history/www/\"  aria-label=\"History Writing Prize Competition (opens in a new tab)\"  >History Writing Prize Competition</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"mit-grants-for-writing-service-and-research\">MIT Grants for Writing, Service, and Research</h3>\n\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.mit.edu/eloranta/\"  aria-label=\"Eloranta Summer Fellowships (opens in a new tab)\"  >Eloranta Summer Fellowships</a></p>\n<p><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"https://pkgcenter.mit.edu/programs/fellowships/\"  aria-label=\"Public Service Fellowships and Grants (opens in a new tab)\"  >Public Service Fellowships and Grants</a></p>\n",
